">Publish from Cinema 4D (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from houdini (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-houdini-beta-2\">Publish from Houdini (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from solidworks (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-solidworks-beta-2\">Publish from SolidWorks (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from spline, and figma (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-spline-and-figma-beta-2\">Publish from Spline, and Figma (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"camera paths and default walkthroughs\" href=\"/docs/guides/camera-paths\" id=\"lnk-camera-paths-and-default-walkthroughs-2\">Camera paths and default walkthroughs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"hotspots and doors\" href=\"/docs/guides/hotspots-and-doors\" id=\"lnk-hotspots-and-doors-2\">Hotspots and doors</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse capture: film a room (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/film-a-room\" id=\"lnk-verse-capture-film-a-room-beta-2\">Verse Capture: film a room (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse play: host a web game\" href=\"/docs/guides/host-a-web-game\" id=\"lnk-verse-play-host-a-web-game-2\">Verse Play: host a web game</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"spatial bench\" href=\"/docs/guides/spatial-bench\" id=\"lnk-spatial-bench-2\">Spatial Bench</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"light and dark theme\" href=\"/docs/guides/light-and-dark-theme\" id=\"lnk-light-and-dark-theme-2\">Light and dark theme</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"share privately with tokens\" href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-2\">Share privately with tokens</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"show your clients who looked\" href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-show-your-clients-who-looked-2\">Show your clients who looked</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed anywhere: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"take-the-guided-tour\">Take the guided tour<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#take-the-guided-tour\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p>Every page of Verse has a guided tour: the product page, the app, Studio\nand these docs. It points at the real controls, one at a time, and says in\na sentence or two what each one does. Several steps ask you to try the\ncontrol yourself (drag the scene, press <strong>Walk</strong>) and move on when you\nhave.</p>\n<p><strong>You need:</strong> nothing. No account, no upload. The app tour loads a demo\nscene for you.</p>\n<h2 id=\"start-it\">Start it<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#start-it\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><strong>First visit:</strong> a small invitation appears on the page: &quot;New here?\nTake the 2-minute tour&quot;. Click it to start, or close it; it does not\ncome back once dismissed.</li><li><strong>Any time:</strong> the <strong>Tour</strong> entry in the navigation of every page opens\nthe chapter list. Start from the beginning, resume where you stopped, or\njump straight to a chapter such as &quot;Uploading your model&quot;.</li><li><strong>By link:</strong> add <code>?guide=&lt;surface&gt;</code> to a page address. The surfaces are\n<code>app</code>, <code>studio</code> and <code>docs</code>; the product page uses <code>/#guide=landing</code>\n(a query on <code>/</code> opens the app). A chapter or step id after a colon opens\nthe tour there.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Link</th><th>Opens</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>/#guide=landing</code></td><td>The product tour, from the top</td></tr><tr><td><code>/app?guide=app</code></td><td>The app tour, from the top</td></tr><tr><td><code>/app?guide=app:upload</code></td><td>The app tour at &quot;Uploading your model&quot;</td></tr><tr><td><code>/studio?guide=studio</code></td><td>The Studio tour</td></tr><tr><td><code>/docs/?guide=docs</code></td><td>The docs tour</td></tr><tr><td>any page with <code>?guide=0</code></td><td>No chip and no tour on that visit</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Nothing ever opens by itself. The tour does not appear inside an embedded\nviewer. (<code>?tour=</code> is a different thing: in the app it plays a recorded\ncamera tour.)</p>\n<h2 id=\"chapters\">Chapters<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#chapters\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Use these ids after the colon, or pick the chapter from the list.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Page</th><th>Chapter ids</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Product page (<code>landing</code>)</td><td><code>what</code> · <code>how</code> · <code>features</code> · <code>start</code></td></tr><tr><td>App (<code>app</code>)</td><td><code>scene</code> · <code>navigate</code> · <code>walk</code> · <code>auto-tour</code> · <code>review</code> · <code>export</code> · <code>quality</code> · <code>share</code> · <code>upload</code></td></tr><tr><td>Studio (<code>studio</code>)</td><td><code>account</code> · <code>library</code> · <code>sharing</code></td></tr><tr><td>Docs (<code>docs</code>)</td><td><code>navigate</code> · <code>guides</code> · <code>reference</code> · <code>news</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>From code, <code>window.verseOnboarding.start(&quot;app&quot;, &quot;upload&quot;)</code> does the same\nthing, and <code>window.verseOnboarding.chapters(&quot;app&quot;)</code> lists them.</p>\n<h2 id=\"move-through-it\">Move through it<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#move-through-it\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Control</th><th>Does</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Next</strong> or the right arrow key</td><td>Next step</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Back</strong> or the left arrow key</td><td>Previous step</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Skip</strong>, the close button, or <code>Esc</code></td><td>Close the tour; your place is remembered</td></tr><tr><td>The list button in the panel</td><td>Chapter list: jump anywhere</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>A step marked <strong>Try it</strong> waits for you to use the highlighted control and\nthen advances. You can always press <strong>Next</strong> instead. While you are in\nwalk mode the arrow keys belong to walking, so use the buttons there.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-each-tour-covers\">What each tour covers<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-each-tour-covers\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><strong>Product page:</strong> what Verse is, the live demo, how a file\nbecomes a link, what you can do with one, and where to start. Its last\nstep opens the app and the tour carries on there.</li><li><strong>App:</strong> loading a demo scene; orbit, zoom and keyboard control; the\nmeasure tool; walk mode and the floor-plan minimap; the automatic camera\ntour; review comments; video export; quality options; sharing; and\nuploading your own model, with the formats and limits read from the\nserver.</li><li><strong>Studio:</strong> the account token, your scene library and its numbers,\nunlisted and private visibility, per-person share links, embed snippets,\ndeleting and claiming scenes.</li><li><strong>Docs:</strong> the sidebar and search, the how-to guides, the exporters for\nBlender, Unity and Unreal, the API, the changelog and the blog.</li></ul>\n<p>If a control is not on the page (the outline column on a narrow screen,\nfor example) the tour skips that step rather than point at nothing.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-it-stores-and-sends\">What it stores and sends<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-it-stores-and-sends\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Progress is kept in your browser&#39;s local storage under the key\n<code>verse-onboarding</code>: which step you reached on each page, whether you\nfinished, and whether you closed the chip. Clear it to see the chip again.\nNothing about you is stored on the server.</p>\n<p>The tour reports four anonymous events through the same telemetry channel\nthe viewer uses: started, furthest step reached, completed, and skipped at\nstep N. Each carries the page name and the step id only. See the\n<a href=\"/docs/telemetry\" id=\"lnk-telemetry-schema\">telemetry schema</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"related\">Related<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#related\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-7\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/docs/getting-started\" id=\"lnk-getting-started-3\">Getting started</a> covers the same ground as the\napp tour, in writing.</li><li><a href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-3\">Collect client review comments</a>,\n<a href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-3\">Export a flythrough video</a> and\n<a href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-3\">Share privately with tokens</a> go deeper on the\nfeatures the tour introduces.</li></ul></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/guides/take-the-tour\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#start-it\" id=\"lnk-start-it\">Start it</a><a href=\"#chapters\" id=\"lnk-chapters\">Chapters</a><a href=\"#move-through-it\" id=\"lnk-move-through-it\">Move through it</a><a href=\"#what-each-tour-covers\" id=\"lnk-what-each-tour-covers\">What each tour covers</a><a href=\"#what-it-stores-and-sends\" id=\"lnk-what-it-stores-and-sends\">What it stores and sends</a><a href=\"#related\" id=\"lnk-related\">Related</a></aside></section>"}